      "text_helper": "Section 22.5.8 \"R6\" in chapter 22 (Secure digital input/output interface (SDIO)), RM0008 Rev 21, page 604.",
      "section_content": "Only for SD I/O. The normal response to CMD3 by a memory device. It is shown in\nTable166.\n[Table 166. R6 response]\nThe card [23:8] status bits are changed when CMD3 is sent to an I/O-only card. In this case,\nthe 16 bits of response are the SD I/O-only values:\n• Bit [15] COM_CRC_ERROR\n• Bit [14] ILLEGAL_COMMAND\n• Bit [13] ERROR\n• Bits [12:0] Reserved",
